WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:01.470
Speaker 1: All right.

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:07.009
I do have another story today of another one
of these anti-vax, unvaccinated people that

00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:13.870
has died of COVID, but this one is particularly
insidious because of the details.

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:16.470
This is someone who wanted to get infected.

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:22.220
They wanted the immunity that they believed
getting infected with the virus would give

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:25.339
them, and they are now dead.

00:00:25.339 --> 00:00:33.610
Hannah Hauschka, a Czech singer, is dead after
intentionally getting infected with COVID.

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:37.070
The BBC by Ben Tobias reporting on this.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:43.800
A folk singer from the Czech Republic has
died after deliberately catching COVID.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:50.680
Hannah Hauschka was 57 years old, was unvaccinated,
posted on social media that she was recovering

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:53.960
after testing positive and was dead.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:01:01.510
Two days later, her son said she got infected
on purpose when he and his father had the

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:08.360
virus so she could get a recovery pass to
access certain venues.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:13.550
The Czech Republic reported a record number
of COVID cases yesterday.

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:19.470
Mr Reck and his father, who are both fully
vaccinated, both caught COVID over Christmas.

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:24.850
But he said his mother decided not to stay
away from them, preferring instead to expose

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:25.940
herself.

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:29.260
He said she should have isolated for a week
because we tested positive, but she was with

00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:30.870
us the whole time.

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:36.850
Proof of vaccination or recent infection from
the virus is required in the Czech Republic

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:40.670
to go to many venues, including movie theaters,
bars and cafes.

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:44.700
His mother was a member of one of the oldest
Czech folk groups, abstinence.

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:49.050
She had wanted to catch COVID, so there would
be fewer restrictions on her two days before

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:50.770
she died, she wrote on social media.

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:52.540
She was recovering quote.

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:57.900
Now there will be a theater, sauna, a concert
Sunday morning, the day she died, she said

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:01.560
she was feeling better and got dressed to
go for a walk.

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:03.600
Her back started hurting.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:06.840
She went to lie down in her bedroom, her son
says.

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:10.090
In 10 minutes, it was all over.

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:13.110
She choked to death.

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:18.890
Although she was unvaccinated, John, her son
stressed his mother didn't believe in some

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:23.970
of the more bizarre conspiracy theories about
COVID vaccines.

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:28.590
Her philosophy was she was more OK with the
idea of catching it than getting vaccinated.

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:32.120
Not that we would get microchipped or anything
like that.

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:36.190
There was no point in trying to discuss the
issue with her as it would get too emotional.

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:41.330
Instead, he hoped that by telling his story,
he could convince others to get vaccinated.

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:43.980
That's the hope.

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:51.690
How scary is it that she felt good enough
to go for a walk and ten minutes later was

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:52.690
dead?

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:58.650
That is absolutely horrifying, and we talk
about sympathy.

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:03.410
You know, every one of these situations is
different.

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:09.599
But this is someone who not only refused to
get vaccinated but deliberately got sick.

00:03:09.599 --> 00:03:16.129
She she deliberately exposed herself to the
virus, refused the best protection we have

00:03:16.129 --> 00:03:22.819
against serious illness and death when we
have a highly effective and protective vaccine.

00:03:22.819 --> 00:03:25.210
Where is this on the spectrum of sympathy?

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:27.190
I don't know.

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:30.019
And there is a case to be made that big picture.

00:03:30.019 --> 00:03:32.840
The recovery passes are kind of a silly idea.

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:38.940
Now, if you test positive in another country
and you can't get back to the U.S. and because

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:44.540
you've tested positive, testing may not be
accurate for a long period of time.

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:48.990
In that situation, it makes sense to say I
believe this individual has recovered.

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:51.080
They should be allowed to go back to the U.S..

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.550
That makes sense to me.

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:58.069
If you have as a policy to go to indoor restaurants,
you got to be vaccinated or to go to movie

00:03:58.069 --> 00:04:00.620
theaters, you've got to be vaccinated.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:06.069
Vaccinated or recovery certificate doesn't
seem like a very good idea, particularly since

00:04:06.069 --> 00:04:11.970
we don't really know that much, particularly
in the context of Akron.

00:04:11.970 --> 00:04:15.239
For how long are you protected after recovery?

00:04:15.239 --> 00:04:17.470
We just don't know the answers to those questions.

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:19.980
It seems problematic to me.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:26.010
And so, you know, her whole goal here was
let me get sick to get better, to be recovered

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:28.990
to then be able to go places without being
vaccinated.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:33.479
Even the pretext of that, even that as a pretext
does not seem logical to me.

00:04:33.479 --> 00:04:36.810
But another tragic story.

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:39.790
Unvaccinated person says, I'm going to go
and get myself sick in order to recover and

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:40.790
have immunity.

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:41.850
It didn't work.

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:42.880
She is dead.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:45.590
And we will have more on this on our Instagram.

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:49.630
You can find that at The David Pakman Show
on Instagram.

00:04:49.630 --> 00:05:52.000
You can also find me there at David Pakman.

